" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -824.5 2386.1 1129.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1786,412.3) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2296\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2296\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-305.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. The shapes of the cation and anion are respectively <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.14ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.525ex\" height=\"0.084ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 25 2000 37\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.14ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.525ex\" height=\"0.084ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 25 2000 37\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> .</p>\n","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<p>bent, square planar</p>\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"<p>linear, square planar</p>\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"<p>bent, see-saw</p>\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":"<p>linear, tetrahedral</p>"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>First, let us recall the autoionization of bromine trifluoride:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.69ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"23.545ex\" height=\"2.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -823.8 10406.8 1128.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(667,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3134.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"21CC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-21CC\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(4412.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1786,411.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-297.3) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7020.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(8020.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1786,411.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-305.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>We have to determine the shapes of the cation and the anion.</p>\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><p>Central atom: Br  </p></li>\n<li><p>Valence electrons of Br = 7  </p></li>\n<li><p>Each F contributes one bond → 2 Br–F bonds = 2 pairs of bonding electrons</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>So, total electrons around Br for shape determination:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"50.53ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 22334.4 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(722.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1722.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2222.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(2611.4,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">by bonding</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(8611.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(9222.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(10222.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(10722.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(11111.9,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">positive charge</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(20111.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(20778.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(21834.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>These 4 electrons form <strong>2 lone pairs</strong> on Br.</p>\n<p>Hence, the total number of electron pairs around Br =  </p>\n<p>2 (bonding) + 2 (lone pairs) = 4 electron domains.</p>\n<p>According to VSEPR theory:  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>4 electron pairs → tetrahedral electron geometry  </p></li>\n<li><p>With 2 bonding and 2 lone pairs → <strong>bent shape</strong></p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Thus, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.673ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.398ex\" height=\"2.537ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -823.8 2386.1 1121.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1786,411.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-297.3) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is <strong>bent</strong>.</p>\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><p>Central atom: Br  </p></li>\n<li><p>Valence electrons of Br = 7  </p></li>\n<li><p>Each F contributes one bond → 4 Br–F bonds = 4 pairs of bonding electrons  </p></li>\n<li><p>Additional one electron due to negative charge → +1</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Hence total electrons on central bromine:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.073ex\" height=\"1.717ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -677 5778.4 759\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(722.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1722.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2444.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3444.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4222.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(5278.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>which means <strong>2 lone pairs</strong> on Br.</p>\n<p>Thus, the total number of electron pairs =  </p>\n<p>4 (bonding) + 2 (lone pairs) = 6 electron domains.</p>\n<p>According to VSEPR theory:  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>6 electron domains → octahedral electron geometry  </p></li>\n<li><p>With 4 bonding and 2 lone pairs → <strong>square planar shape</strong></p></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Shapes are:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.673ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.398ex\" height=\"2.537ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -823.8 2386.1 1121.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1786,411.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-297.3) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> → <strong>bent</strong></p></li>\n<li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.69ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.398ex\" height=\"2.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -823.8 2386.1 1128.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1786,411.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-305.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> → <strong>square planar</strong></p></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Correct Option: A)</strong> bent, square planar</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p>ब्रोमीन ट्राइफ्लोराइड स्वआयनन से <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.673ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.398ex\" height=\"2.538ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -824.5 2386.1 1121.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1786,412.3) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2295\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2295\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-297.3) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> और <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.69ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.398ex\" height=\"2.556ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -824.5 2386.1 1129.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1786,412.3) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2296\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2296\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-305.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> उत्पन्न करता है। धनायन और ऋणायन की आकृति क्रमशः <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.14ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.525ex\" height=\"0.084ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 25 2000 37\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> और <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.14ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.525ex\" height=\"0.084ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 25 2000 37\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"><use data-c=\"5F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5F\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> है।</p>\n\n\n\n","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<p>बंकित, वर्ग समतली</p>"},{"identifier":"B","content":"<p>रैखिक, वर्ग-समतली</p>"},{"identifier":"C","content":"<p>बंकित, ढेकुली (सी-सॉ)</p>"},{"identifier":"D","content":"<p>रैखिक, चतुष्फलकीय</p>"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>सबसे पहले, आइए ब्रोमीन ट्राइफ्लोराइड के स्व-आयनन (autoionization) को याद करें:</p><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.69ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"23.545ex\" height=\"2.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -823.8 10406.8 1128.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(667,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3134.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"21CC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-21CC\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(4412.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1786,411.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-297.3) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7020.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(8020.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1786,411.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-305.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p><p>हमें धनायन और ऋणायन के आकार निर्धारित करने हैं।</p><ul><li><p>केंद्रीय परमाणु: Br</p></li><li><p>Br के संयोजी (Valence) इलेक्ट्रॉन = 7</p></li><li><p>प्रत्येक F एक आबंध का योगदान करता है → 2 Br–F आबंध = आबंधी इलेक्ट्रॉनों (bonding electrons) के 2 युग्म</p></li></ul><p>इसलिए, आकार निर्धारण के लिए Br के चारों ओर कुल इलेक्ट्रॉन:</p><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"39.671ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 17534.4 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(722.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1722.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2222.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(2611.4,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">आबंध द्वारा</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(9211.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(9822.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(10822.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(11322.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(11711.9,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">धनावेश</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(15311.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(15978.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(17034.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p><p>ये 4 इलेक्ट्रॉन Br पर <strong>2 एकाकी युग्म (lone pairs)</strong> बनाते हैं।</p><p>अतः, Br के चारों ओर इलेक्ट्रॉन युग्मों की कुल संख्या =</p><p>2 (आबंधी) + 2 (एकाकी युग्म) = 4 इलेक्ट्रॉन डोमेन।</p><p>VSEPR सिद्धांत के अनुसार:</p><ul><li><p>4 इलेक्ट्रॉन युग्म → चतुष्फलकीय (tetrahedral) इलेक्ट्रॉन ज्यामिति</p></li><li><p>2 आबंधी और 2 एकाकी युग्मों के साथ → <strong>मुड़ा हुआ आकार (bent shape)</strong></p></li></ul><p>इस प्रकार, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.673ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.398ex\" height=\"2.537ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -823.8 2386.1 1121.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1786,411.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-297.3) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> <strong>मुड़ा हुआ (bent)</strong> है।</p><ul><li><p>केंद्रीय परमाणु: Br</p></li><li><p>Br के संयोजी (Valence) इलेक्ट्रॉन = 7</p></li><li><p>प्रत्येक F एक आबंध का योगदान करता है → 4 Br–F आबंध = आबंधी इलेक्ट्रॉनों के 4 युग्म</p></li><li><p>ऋणावेश के कारण एक अतिरिक्त इलेक्ट्रॉन → +1</p></li></ul><p>अतः केंद्रीय ब्रोमीन पर कुल इलेक्ट्रॉन:</p><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.073ex\" height=\"1.717ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -677 5778.4 759\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(722.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1722.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2444.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3444.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4222.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(5278.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p><p>जिसका अर्थ है कि Br पर <strong>2 एकाकी युग्म</strong> हैं।</p><p>इस प्रकार, इलेक्ट्रॉन युग्मों की कुल संख्या =</p><p>4 (आबंधी) + 2 (एकाकी युग्म) = 6 इलेक्ट्रॉन डोमेन।</p><p>VSEPR सिद्धांत के अनुसार:</p><ul><li><p>6 इलेक्ट्रॉन डोमेन → अष्टफलकीय (octahedral) इलेक्ट्रॉन ज्यामिति</p></li><li><p>4 आबंधी और 2 एकाकी युग्मों के साथ → <strong>वर्ग समतलीय आकार (square planar shape)</strong></p></li></ul><p>आकार हैं:</p><ul><li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.673ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.398ex\" height=\"2.537ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -823.8 2386.1 1121.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1786,411.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-297.3) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> → <strong>मुड़ा हुआ (bent)</strong></p></li><li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.69ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.398ex\" height=\"2.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -823.8 2386.1 1128.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1786,411.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-305.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> → <strong>वर्ग समतलीय (square planar)</strong></p></li></ul><p><strong>सही विकल्प: A)</strong> मुड़ा हुआ, वर्ग समतलीय</p>"}},"subject":"chemistry","timeAllotted":144000,"topic":"hybridization-and-vsepr-theory","type":"mcq","year":2026,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":[],"yearKey":"jee-main-2026-online-8th-april-evening-shift","active":true,"options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<p>bent, square planar</p>\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"<p>linear, square planar</p>\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"<p>bent, see-saw</p>\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":"<p>linear, tetrahedral</p>"}],"correct_options":["A"],"explanation":"<p>First, let us recall the autoionization of bromine trifluoride:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.69ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"23.545ex\" height=\"2.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -823.8 10406.8 1128.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(667,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3134.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"21CC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-21CC\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(4412.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1786,411.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-297.3) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7020.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(8020.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1786,411.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-305.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>We have to determine the shapes of the cation and the anion.</p>\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><p>Central atom: Br  </p></li>\n<li><p>Valence electrons of Br = 7  </p></li>\n<li><p>Each F contributes one bond → 2 Br–F bonds = 2 pairs of bonding electrons</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>So, total electrons around Br for shape determination:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"50.53ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 22334.4 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(722.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1722.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2222.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(2611.4,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">by bonding</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(8611.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(9222.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(10222.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(10722.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(11111.9,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">positive charge</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(20111.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(20778.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(21834.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>These 4 electrons form <strong>2 lone pairs</strong> on Br.</p>\n<p>Hence, the total number of electron pairs around Br =  </p>\n<p>2 (bonding) + 2 (lone pairs) = 4 electron domains.</p>\n<p>According to VSEPR theory:  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>4 electron pairs → tetrahedral electron geometry  </p></li>\n<li><p>With 2 bonding and 2 lone pairs → <strong>bent shape</strong></p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Thus, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.673ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.398ex\" height=\"2.537ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -823.8 2386.1 1121.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1786,411.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-297.3) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is <strong>bent</strong>.</p>\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><p>Central atom: Br  </p></li>\n<li><p>Valence electrons of Br = 7  </p></li>\n<li><p>Each F contributes one bond → 4 Br–F bonds = 4 pairs of bonding electrons  </p></li>\n<li><p>Additional one electron due to negative charge → +1</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Hence total electrons on central bromine:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.073ex\" height=\"1.717ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -677 5778.4 759\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(722.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1722.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2444.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3444.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4222.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(5278.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>which means <strong>2 lone pairs</strong> on Br.</p>\n<p>Thus, the total number of electron pairs =  </p>\n<p>4 (bonding) + 2 (lone pairs) = 6 electron domains.</p>\n<p>According to VSEPR theory:  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>6 electron domains → octahedral electron geometry  </p></li>\n<li><p>With 4 bonding and 2 lone pairs → <strong>square planar shape</strong></p></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Shapes are:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.673ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.398ex\" height=\"2.537ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -823.8 2386.1 1121.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1786,411.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-297.3) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> → <strong>bent</strong></p></li>\n<li><p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.69ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.398ex\" height=\"2.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -823.8 2386.1 1128.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"42\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-42\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(708,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\" transform=\"translate(1100,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1786,411.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1786,-305.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> → <strong>square planar</strong></p></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Correct Option: A)</strong> bent, square planar</p>"}]}